SkillBuilder 3: Practical Gen AI Foundations
Project: AI and Your Future

INTRODUCTION

AI isn’t just hype — it’s reshaping the way we work, think, and solve problems. In this Project, you’ll explore what AI means for you by reflecting on expert perspectives, 
experimenting with tools (not just ChatGPT!), and evaluating their real-world potential. The goal is simple: build confidence, gain hands-on experience, and develop your own 
point of view on this fast-moving technology.
